  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 72 – 56 + (13 + 19) × 2 - 95 ÷ 5 + 17 = 76\n\nOption 1) 19 and 5\n\nTwo numbers need to be interchanged then:\n\n⇒ 72 – 56 + (__**13 + 5**__) × 2 - __**95 ÷ 19**__ + 17 = 76\n\n⇒ 72 – 56 + (__**18) × 2**__ - 5 + 17 = 76\n\n⇒ 72 – 56 + 36 - 5 + 17 = 76\n\n⇒ __**125 - 61**__ = 75\n\n⇒ 64 ≠ 75\n\nOption 2) 19 and 17</strong&g",
